+# Task
+
+Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) as `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+
+## What was done
+
+- `src/index.ts`: `resolvePointer` and the `JsonValue` type. Throws on invalid pointers and on
+  pointers that do not resolve.
+- `test/pointer.test.ts`: the RFC §5 examples, escape order, falsy values, invalid and unresolvable
+  pointers. Run with `npm test`.
+- Design choices are in decision-log dl-001.
